## Key Decisions Made Today

1. **Per-field safe coercion over all-or-nothing fallback**: previously, one bad field in an otherwise-good AI response discarded the entire real evaluation. Now each field is independently validated/clamped/defaulted, so real AI content is preserved whenever possible — only a total parse failure triggers the Mock fallback.
2. **`@st.cache_resource` for the AI provider**: eliminates redundant client instantiation on every single AI call, a meaningful performance improvement with zero behavior change.

